msgid "In fact, basename-based conditions are built as a list of « must match one of » and « must not match any of » patterns. In order for your action to be a candidate regarding these basename-based conditions, each element of the selection must be valid for all the listed conditions: the basename of each element must match at least one of the defined « must match one of » patterns, and must not match any of the defined « must not match any of » patterns."
