#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/cact-edit.xml:12
#: C/index.docbook:12
msgid "Be warned that selecting and deleting all profiles of an action leaves it without any profile, so in an invalid state. The name of the action will be written in red (because it is invalid) and italic (because it has been modified) characters."
