#. (itstool) path: sect1/title
#: C/index.docbook:73
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "ບົດນຳ"

#. (itstool) path: sect1/para
#: C/index.docbook:80
msgid "The <application>Caja-Actions Configuration Tool</application> application is the user interface which lets you precisely configure how, where and when your actions should appear in <productname>Caja</productname> context menus, and how they will be executed."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ <application>ເຄື່ອງມືຕັ້ງຄ່າ Caja-Actions</application> ແມ່ນສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃ"
"ຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນວ່າ ວິທີໃດ, ຢູ່ໃສ ແລະ ເວລາໃດ ທີ່ການກະທຳຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນເມນູ"
"ຄລິກຂວາຂອງ <productname>Caja</productname>, ແລະ ພວກມັນຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດແນວໃດ."

#. (itstool) path: sect1/para
#: C/index.docbook:85
msgid "<application>Caja-Actions Configuration Tool</application> provides the following features:"
msgstr ""
"<application>ເຄື່ອງມືຕັ້ງຄ່າ Caja-Actions</application> ມີຄຸນສົມບັດດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:90
msgid "Define and configure actions from scratch."
msgstr "ກຳນົດ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າການກະທຳໃໝ່ແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:93
msgid "Organize actions into menus, submenus and so on."
msgstr "ຈັດລະບຽບການກະທຳເປັນເມນູ, ເມນູຍ່ອຍ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:96
msgid "Import and export actions and menus from and to outside world."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ສົ່ງອອກການກະທຳ ແລະ ເມນູຈາກ ແລະ ໄປຫາພາຍນອກ."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:100
msgid "<productname>Caja-Actions</productname> also comes with additional features such as:"
msgstr ""
"<productname>Caja-Actions</productname> ຍັງມາພ້ອມກັບຄຸນສົມບັດເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເຊັ່ນ:"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:105
msgid "A <productname>Caja</productname> plugin which exports in real time to D-Bus the currently selected files."
msgstr ""
"ປລັກອິນ <productname>Caja</productname> ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນໄປຫາ D-Bus ແບບ"
"ໃຊ້ເວລາຈິງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:111
msgid "A command-line program which is able to run any action."
msgstr "ໂປຣແກຣມແຖວຄຳສັ່ງ (command-line) ທີ່ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການກະທຳໃດໆກໍໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:114
msgid "Associated with the D-Bus interface, this program lets the user run any action from a keyboard shortcut, applying this action to the item(s) currently selected in the file manager."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ D-Bus, ໂປຣແກຣມນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການກະທຳໃດໆກໍໄດ້ຈາກທາງລັດແປ້ນພິ"
"ມ, ໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ການກະທຳນີ້ກັບລາຍການທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຢູ່ໃນຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:121
msgid "A command-line program which is able to create a new action."
msgstr "ໂປຣແກຣມແຖວຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ສາມາດສ້າງການກະທຳໃໝ່ໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:126
msgid "All these features are more thoroughly described in the global <productname>Caja-Actions</productname> documentation."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດທັງໝົດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ຖືກອະທິບາຍຢ່າງລະອຽດຕື່ມໃນເອກະສານລວມຂອງ <productname>Caja-Actions</"
"productname>."

