msgid "Define the scheme filters the <productname>Caja</productname> selection must satisfy in order the action or menu be candidate for display."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຕົວຕອງຮູບແບບ (scheme) ທີ່ສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກໃນ <productname>Caja</productname> ຕ້ອງສອດຄ່ອງ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການກະທຳ ຫຼື ເມນູນັ້ນມີສິດຖືກສະແດງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:348
msgid "Define the capability filters the <productname>Caja</productname> selection must satisfy in order the action or menu be candidate for display."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຕົວຕອງຄວາມສາມາດ (capability) ທີ່ສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກໃນ <productname>Caja</productname> ຕ້ອ"
"ງສອດຄ່ອງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການກະທຳ ຫຼື ເມນູນັ້ນມີສິດຖືກສະແດງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:360
msgid "Define some environment conditions the <productname>Caja</productname> selection must satisfy in order the action or menu be candidate for display."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດບາງເງື່ອນໄຂສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກໃນ <productname>Caja</productname> ຕ້ອງສອດຄ່ອງ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການກະທຳ ຫຼື ເມນູນັ້ນມີສິດຖືກສະແດງ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:392
msgid "The « read-only » icon <inlinegraphic fileref=\"figures/read-only.png\"/> is displayed in the right of the statusbar when appropriate."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນ « ອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ » <inlinegraphic fileref=\"figures/read-only.png\"/> ຈະສະແດ"
"ງຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງແຖບສະຖານະເມື່ອເໝາະສົມ."

#. (itstool) path: formalpara/para
#: C/index.docbook:412
msgid "This action will require <productname>MateDialog</productname>."
msgstr "ການກະທຳນີ້ຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ <productname>MateDialog</productname>."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:416
msgid "<productname>MateDialog</productname> is a program which will allow you to create a graphical user interface from a command-line."
msgstr ""
"<productname>MateDialog</productname> ແມ່ນໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແ"
"ບບກຣາບຟິກຈາກແຖວຄຳສັ່ງໄດ້."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:425
msgid "<command> <filename>matedialog</filename> </command>"
msgstr "<command> <filename>matedialog</filename> </command>"

#. (itstool) path: formalpara/para
#: C/index.docbook:435
msgid "To create a new action, choose <menuchoice><shortcut><keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>N</keycap></keycombo></shortcut><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>New action</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງການກະທຳໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice><shortcut><keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap>"
"<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo></shortcut><guimenu>ໄຟລ໌</guimenu><guisubmenu>ການ"
"ກະທຳໃໝ່</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."

