#: C/index.docbook:448
msgid "<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/cact-action-tab.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> Shows the default properties of a newly created action. </phrase> </textobject>"
