msgid "<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/cact-command-tab.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> Shows the Command tab. This tab contains the name of the profile, the command to be executed along with its parameters, and the configuration of the starting working directory. </phrase> </textobject>"
