"ມີຊື່ຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌, ຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດພ້ອມກັບພະລາມິເຕີຂອງມັນ, ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງໂຟນເດີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນການເຮັ"
"ດວຽກ. </phrase> </textobject>"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:582
msgid "Enter <userinput>matedialog</userinput> in the <guilabel>Path</guilabel> entry box."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອນ <userinput>matedialog</userinput> ລົງໃນຊ່ອງ <guilabel>ເສັ້ນທາງ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:587
msgid "The <guilabel>Path</guilabel> entry box defines the command which will be executed when you will select your action in the file manager context menu."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງ <guilabel>ເສັ້ນທາງ</guilabel> ກຳນົດຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ຈະຖືກປະຕິບັດ ເມື່ອທ່ານເລືອກການກະທຳຂອງທ່ານໃນເ"
"ມນູຄລິກຂວາຂອງຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:598
msgid "Enter it in the <guilabel>Path</guilabel> entry box."
msgstr "ປ້ອນມັນລົງໃນຊ່ອງ <guilabel>ເສັ້ນທາງ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:604
msgid "Click on <guibutton>Browse</guibutton> to select the executable file on the filesystem."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກໃສ່ <guibutton>ເລືອກເບິ່ງ</guibutton> ເພື່ອເລືອກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສາມາດປະຕິບັດໄດ້ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:610
msgid "If the command you enter does not have an absolute path, then it will be searched for in the <envar>PATH</envar> variable at execution time."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ທ່ານປ້ອນບໍ່ມີເສັ້ນທາງແບບເຕັມ, ມັນຈະຖືກຄົ້ນຫາໃນຕົວປ່ຽນ <envar>PATH</envar> ໃນເວລາປະຕິບັ"
"ດການ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:617
msgid "Enter <userinput>--info --text='%c selected item(s): %U'</userinput> in the <guilabel>Parameters</guilabel> entry box."
msgstr ""
"ປ້ອນ <userinput>--info --text='%c selected item(s): %U'</userinput> ລົງໃນຊ່ອງ "
"<guilabel>ພະລາມິເຕີ</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:624
msgid "The <guilabel>Parameters</guilabel> contains the arguments which will be passed to your command when it will be executed. These arguments may embed parameters which will be expanded at runtime."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງ <guilabel>ພະລາມິເຕີ</guilabel> ປະກອບມີອາກິວເມັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາຄຳສັ່ງຂອງທ່ານເມື່ອມັນຖືກປະຕິ"
"ບັດ. ອາກິວເມັ້ນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະມີພະລາມິເຕີທີ່ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:631
msgid "If both <guilabel>Path</guilabel> and <guilabel>Parameters</guilabel> are empty, then this action will be considered as invalid: it will be displayed in red in <guilabel>Items list</guilabel> and will never be candidate to be displayed in the file manager context menus."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທັງ <guilabel>ເສັ້ນທາງ</guilabel> ແລະ <guilabel>ພະລາມິເຕີ</guilabel> ວ່າງເປົ່າ, ການ"
"ກະທຳນີ້ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ: ມັນຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນສີແດງໃນ <guilabel>ລາຍການລາຍການ</guilabel> ແລ"
"ະ ຈະບໍ່ມີສິດຖືກນຳມາສະແດງໃນເມນູຄລິກຂວາຂອງຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌."

#. (itstool) path: formalpara/para
#: C/index.docbook:644
msgid "To save all pending modifications, choose <menuchoice><shortcut><keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>S</keycap></keycombo></shortcut><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>Save</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
