#: C/index.docbook:402
#: C/index.docbook:523
msgid "Press <keycap>Insert</keycap> or click on <guibutton><inlinegraphic fileref=\"figures/add.png\"/></guibutton> button to insert a new condition filter"
msgstr ""
"ກົດ <keycap>Insert</keycap> ຫຼື ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມ <guibutton><inlinegraphic "
"fileref=\"figures/add.png\"/></guibutton> ເພື່ອແຊກຕົວຕອງເງື່ອນໄຂໃໝ່"

#. (itstool) path: tip/para
#: C/index.docbook:87
msgid "A basename-based condition may use « <literal>*</literal> » or « <literal>?</literal> » wildcard characters."
msgstr ""
"ເງື່ອນໄຂຕາມຊື່ພື້ນຖານອາດຈະໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນຕົວແທນ (wildcard) ເຊັ່ນ « <literal>*</literal> » ຫຼື "
"« <literal>?</literal> »."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:100
#: C/index.docbook:274
#: C/index.docbook:435
#: C/index.docbook:574
msgid "Click on the <guilabel>Must match one of</guilabel> or <guilabel>Must not match any of</guilabel> radio button in the same row to set the corresponding condition."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມເລືອກ <guilabel>ຕ້ອງກົງກັບອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງຂອງ</guilabel> ຫຼື <guilabel>ຕ້ອງບໍ່ກົງກັບອັນໃດເ"
"ລີຍຂອງ</guilabel> ໃນແຖວດຽວກັນເພື່ອຕັ້ງເງື່ອນໄຂທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/index.docbook:109
msgid "Depending of your target operating system, make sure that the <guilabel>Match case</guilabel> checkbox is activated (or not)."
msgstr ""
"ຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຊ່ອງໝາຍ <guilabel>ຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍຕ້ອງກົງກັ"
"ນ</guilabel> ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ (ຫຼື ບໍ່)."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:116
msgid "When activated, all filters are considered as case sensitive, which means that <filename>/my/file</filename> filename is considered distinct from <filename>/My/File</filename> one."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, ຕົວຕອງທັງໝົດຈະຖືວ່າຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່ ແລະ ນ້ອຍແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຊື່ໄຟລ໌ "
"<filename>/my/file</filename> ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າຕ່າງຈາກ <filename>/My/File</filename>."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:128
msgid "When deactivated, filters are considered as case insensitive, which means that <filename>/my/file</filename> and <filename>/My/File</filename> filenames are considered the same name."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້, ຕົວຕອງຈະຖືວ່າຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່ ແລະ ນ້ອຍບໍ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຊື່ໄຟລ໌ <filename>/"
"my/file</filename> ແລະ <filename>/My/File</filename> ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນຊື່ດຽວກັນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:136
msgid "This is most probably what you want if you target some sort of <productname>Windows</productname> system."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ອາດຈະແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຖ້າທ່ານກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໃສ່ລະບົບ <productname>Windows</"
"productname> ບາງປະເພດ."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/index.docbook:142
msgid "Removing a defined basename-based condition is as simple as selecting it, and pressing <keycap>Del</keycap> (or clicking on <guibutton><inlinegraphic fileref=\"figures/remove.png\"/></guibutton> button)."
msgstr ""
"ການລຶບເງື່ອນໄຂຕາມຊື່ພື້ນຖານທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ ໂດຍການເລືອກມັນ ແລະ ກົດ <keycap>Del</"
"keycap> (ຫຼື ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມ <guibutton><inlinegraphic fileref=\"figures/remove.png\"/>"
"</guibutton>)."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/index.docbook:149
msgid "By default, the basename-based condition is just one « <literal>must match one of *</literal> » condition. As all basenames always match the « <literal>*</literal> » condition, this just means that basename-based conditions are not considered as relevant for the action."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເງື່ອນໄຂຕາມຊື່ພື້ນຖານແມ່ນມີພຽງແຕ່ເງື່ອນໄຂ « <literal>ຕ້ອງກົງກັບອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງຂອງ *</"
"literal> ». ເນື່ອງຈາກຊື່ພື້ນຖານທັງໝົດຈະກົງກັບເງື່ອນໄຂ « <literal>*</literal> » ສະເໝີ, ນີ້ໝາຍ"
"ຄວາມວ່າເງື່ອນໄຂຕາມຊື່ພື້ນຖານຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳມາພິຈາລະນາສຳລັບການກະທຳນີ້."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/index.docbook:168
msgid "Click on the <guilabel>Mimetypes</guilabel> tab to show the page which will permit you to configure your mimetype-based conditions."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກໃສ່ແຖບ <guilabel>ຊະນິດໄຟລ໌ (Mimetypes)</guilabel> ເພື່ອສະແດງໜ້າທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າເງື່ອນໄ"
"ຂຕາມຊະນິດໄຟລ໌."

