#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/index.docbook:444
msgid "Removing a defined folder-based condition is as simple as selecting it, and pressing <keycap>Del</keycap> (or clicking on <guibutton><inlinegraphic fileref=\"figures/remove.png\"/></guibutton> button)."
msgstr ""
"ການລຶບເງື່ອນໄຂຕາມໂຟນເດີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ ໂດຍການເລືອກມັນ ແລະ ກົດ <keycap>Del</"
