#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/index.docbook:451
msgid "By default, the folder-based condition is just one « <literal>must match one of /</literal> » condition. As <literal>/</literal> is always the top of an Unix-like file system, then all selected items always match this condition."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເງື່ອນໄຂຕາມໂຟນເດີແມ່ນມີພຽງແຕ່ເງື່ອນໄຂ « <literal>ຕ້ອງກົງກັບອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງຂອງ /</"
"literal> ». ເນື່ອງຈາກ <literal>/</literal> ແມ່ນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສູງສຸດຂອງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ແບບ Unix ສະເ"
"ໝີ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທຸກລາຍການທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຈະສອດຄ່ອງກັບເງື່ອນໄຂນີ້ສະເໝີ."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:459
msgid "If you target a <productname>Windows</productname> system, then this default value may not be what you actually want."
msgstr ""
