"ເພື່ອເລືອກຄວາມສາມາດໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ <guibutton>ຕົກລົງ</guibutton>, ຫຼື ດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ແຖວທີ່ຕ້ອງກາ"
"ນ."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:713
msgid "Click on the <guilabel>Must match all of</guilabel> or <guilabel>Must not match any of</guilabel> radio button in the same row to set the corresponding condition."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມເລືອກ <guilabel>ຕ້ອງກົງກັບທັງໝົດຂອງ</guilabel> ຫຼື <guilabel>ຕ້ອງບໍ່ກົງກັບອັນໃດເລີຍຂອ"
"ງ</guilabel> ໃນແຖວດຽວກັນເພື່ອຕັ້ງເງື່ອນໄຂທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/index.docbook:722
msgid "Removing a defined capability-based condition is as simple as selecting it, and pressing <keycap>Del</keycap> (or clicking on <guibutton><inlinegraphic fileref=\"figures/remove.png\"/></guibutton> button)."
msgstr ""
"ການລຶບເງື່ອນໄຂຕາມຄວາມສາມາດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ ໂດຍການເລືອກມັນ ແລະ ກົດ <keycap>Del</"
"keycap> (ຫຼື ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມ <guibutton><inlinegraphic fileref=\"figures/remove.png\"/>"
"</guibutton>)."

#. (itstool) path: example/para
#: C/index.docbook:744
msgid "If your action consists in displaying the differences between two files, you may define here « <literal>Count = (equal to) 2</literal> »."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າການກະທຳຂອງທ່ານປະກອບດ້ວຍການສະແດງຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງສອງໄຟລ໌, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້ວ່າ « "
"<literal>ຈຳນວນ = (ເທົ່າກັບ) 2</literal> »."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/index.docbook:751
#: C/index.docbook:856
#: C/index.docbook:924
msgid "Click on the <guilabel>Environment</guilabel> tab to show the page which will permit you to configure your environment-based conditions."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກໃສ່ແຖບ <guilabel>ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (Environment)</guilabel> ເພື່ອສະແດງໜ້າທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່"
"າເງື່ອນໄຂຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ."

