"DESKTOP_STARTUP_ID</envar>, ໃຫ້ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງ <guilabel>ແຈ້ງເຕືອນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ</guilabel>"
"."

#. (itstool) path: sect4/para
#: C/index.docbook:236
#: C/index.docbook:249
