#. (itstool) path: example/para
#: C/index.docbook:521
msgid "Say the current folder is <filename>/data</filename>, and the current selection contains the three files <filename>pierre</filename>, <filename>paul</filename> and <filename>jacques</filename>."
msgstr ""
"ສົມມຸດວ່າໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນ <filename>/data</filename>, ແລະ ການເລືອກປັດຈຸບັນປະກອບມີສາມໄຟລ໌"
"ຄື <filename>pierre</filename>, <filename>paul</filename> ແລະ <filename>"
"jacques</filename>."

#. (itstool) path: formalpara/title
#: C/index.docbook:528
msgid "If we have requested <command>echo %b</command>,"
msgstr "ຖ້າພວກເຮົາຮ້ອງຂໍ <command>echo %b</command>,"

#. (itstool) path: simplelist/member
#: C/index.docbook:536
msgid "<command>echo pierre</command>"
msgstr "<command>echo pierre</command>"

#. (itstool) path: simplelist/member
#: C/index.docbook:537
msgid "<command>echo paul</command>"
msgstr "<command>echo paul</command>"

#. (itstool) path: simplelist/member
#: C/index.docbook:538
msgid "<command>echo jacques</command>"
msgstr "<command>echo jacques</command>"

#. (itstool) path: example/para
#: C/index.docbook:540
msgid "This is because <literal>%b</literal> marks a <emphasis>singular</emphasis> parameter. The command is then run once for each of the selected items."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຍ້ອນວ່າ <literal>%b</literal> ໝາຍເຖິງພະລາມິເຕີ <emphasis>ເອກະພົດ</emphasis>. ຄຳ"
"ສັ່ງຈຶ່ງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ເທື່ອລະຄັ້ງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລາຍການທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ."

#. (itstool) path: formalpara/title
#: C/index.docbook:545
msgid "Contrarily, if we have requested <command>echo %B</command>,"
msgstr "ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ຖ້າພວກເຮົາຮ້ອງຂໍ <command>echo %B</command>,"

#. (itstool) path: simplelist/member
#: C/index.docbook:553
msgid "<command>echo pierre paul jacques</command>"
msgstr "<command>echo pierre paul jacques</command>"

#. (itstool) path: example/para
#: C/index.docbook:555
msgid "This is because <literal>%B</literal> marks a <emphasis>plural</emphasis> parameter. The command is then run only once, with the list of selected items as arguments."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຍ້ອນວ່າ <literal>%B</literal> ໝາຍເຖິງພະລາມິເຕີ <emphasis>ພະຫຸພົດ</emphasis>. ຄຳສັ່"
"ງຈຶ່ງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ, ໂດຍມີລາຍຊື່ຂອງລາຍການທີ່ຖືກເລືອກເປັນອາກິວເມັ້ນ."

#. (itstool) path: formalpara/title
#: C/index.docbook:561
msgid "If we have requested <command>echo %b %B</command>,"
msgstr "ຖ້າພວກເຮົາຮ້ອງຂໍ <command>echo %b %B</command>,"

#. (itstool) path: simplelist/member
#: C/index.docbook:569
msgid "<command>echo pierre pierre paul jacques</command>"
msgstr "<command>echo pierre pierre paul jacques</command>"

#. (itstool) path: simplelist/member
#: C/index.docbook:570
msgid "<command>echo paul pierre paul jacques</command>"
msgstr "<command>echo paul pierre paul jacques</command>"

#. (itstool) path: simplelist/member
#: C/index.docbook:571
msgid "<command>echo jacques pierre paul jacques</command>"
msgstr "<command>echo jacques pierre paul jacques</command>"

#. (itstool) path: example/para
#: C/index.docbook:573
msgid "This is because the first <emphasis>relevant</emphasis> parameter is <literal>%b</literal>, and so the command is run once for each selected item, replacing at each occurrence the <literal>%b</literal> parameter with the corresponding item. The second parameter is computed and added as arguments to the executed command."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຍ້ອນວ່າພະລາມິເຕີ <emphasis>ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ</emphasis> ຕົວທຳອິດແມ່ນ <literal>%b</literal>"
", ດັ່ງນັ້ນຄຳສັ່ງຈຶ່ງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ເທື່ອລະຄັ້ງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລາຍການທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ, ໂດຍແທນທີ່ <literal>%b</"
"literal> ດ້ວຍລາຍການທີ່ກົງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ. ສ່ວນພະລາມິເຕີທີສອງຈະຖືກຄຳນວນ ແລະ ເພີ່ມເປັນອາກິວເມັ້ນໃຫ້ກັ"
"ບຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ປະຕິບັດ."

#. (itstool) path: formalpara/title
#: C/index.docbook:581
msgid "And if we have requested <literal>echo %B %b</literal>,"
msgstr "ແລະ ຖ້າພວກເຮົາຮ້ອງຂໍ <literal>echo %B %b</literal>,"

#. (itstool) path: simplelist/member
#: C/index.docbook:589
msgid "<command>echo pierre paul jacques pierre</command>"
msgstr "<command>echo pierre paul jacques pierre</command>"

#. (itstool) path: example/para
#: C/index.docbook:591
msgid "This is because the first <emphasis>relevant</emphasis> parameter here is <literal>%B</literal>. The command is then run only once, replacing <literal>%B</literal> with the space-separated list of basenames. As the command is only run once, the <literal>%b</literal> is substituted only once with the (first) basename."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຍ້ອນວ່າພະລາມິເຕີ <emphasis>ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ</emphasis> ຕົວທຳອິດຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້ແມ່ນ <literal>%B</"
"literal>. ຄຳສັ່ງຈຶ່ງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ, ໂດຍແທນທີ່ <literal>%B</literal> ດ້ວຍລາຍຊື່ຊື່ພື້ນຖານທີ່"
"ແຍກກັນດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ. ເນື່ອງຈາກຄຳສັ່ງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ, <literal>%b</literal> ຈຶ່ງຖືກແທນທີ່ພຽງ"
"ແຕ່ຄັ້ງດຽວດ້ວຍຊື່ພື້ນຖານ (ຕົວທຳອິດ)."

#. (itstool) path: example/para
#: C/index.docbook:29
msgid "At runtime, <productname>Caja-Actions</productname> will successively examine each profile attached to your action. If the first profile targets a file while you have selected a directory, then <productname>Caja-Actions</productname> will just try with your second profile."
msgstr ""
"ໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກ, <productname>Caja-Actions</productname> ຈະກວດສອບແຕ່ລະໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຊື່ອມ"
"ຕໍ່ກັບການກະທຳຂອງທ່ານຕາມລຳດັບ. ຖ້າໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທຳອິດກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ ແຕ່ທ່ານເລືອກໂຟນເດີ, "
"<productname>Caja-Actions</productname> ກໍຈະລອງກວດສອບກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີສອງຂອງທ່ານຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:36
msgid "To create a new profile, first select the action in the items list, then choose <menuchoice><guisubmenu>File</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>New profile</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່, ທຳອິດໃຫ້ເລືອກການກະທຳໃນລາຍການລາຍການ, ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກ <menuchoice>"
"<guisubmenu>ໄຟລ໌</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/index.docbook:47
msgid "At runtime, <productname>Caja-Actions</productname> will begin with examining the conditions set on your action."
msgstr ""
"ໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກ, <productname>Caja-Actions</productname> ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການກວດສອບເງື່ອນ"
"ໄຂທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນການກະທຳຂອງທ່ານ."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/index.docbook:51
#: C/index.docbook:55
msgid "If these conditions (the action-conditions) are met, then <productname>Caja-Actions</productname> will examine in order each profile."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເງື່ອນໄຂເຫຼົ່ານີ້ (ເງື່ອນໄຂການກະທຳ) ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ, <productname>Caja-Actions</"
"productname> ຈະກວດສອບແຕ່ລະໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຕາມລຳດັບ."

#. (itstool) path: sect3/para
#: C/index.docbook:64
msgid "Profiles of an action are ordered, and they are examined in that order at runtime. The first profile whose conditions are met will be validated, and made selectable in the <productname>Caja</productname> context menu."
msgstr ""
"ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂອງການກະທຳຈະຖືກຈັດລຳດັບໄວ້, ແລະ ຈະຖືກກວດສອບຕາມລຳດັບນັ້ນໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກ. ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທຳອິດ"
"ທີ່ເງື່ອນໄຂສອດຄ່ອງກັນຈະຖືກຢືນຢັນ, ແລະ ຈະສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ໃນເມນູຄລິກຂວາຂອງ <productname>Caja</"
"productname>."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:7
msgid "In order to create a new menu, choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>New menu</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງເມນູໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <menuchoice><guimenu>ໄຟລ໌</guimenu><guimenuitem>ເມນູໃໝ່</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:8
msgid "A menu may be created anywhere in the list of your actions, but inside of an action (<abbrev>i.e.</abbrev> not between two profiles of an action)."
msgstr ""
"ເມນູສາມາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້ໃນລາຍການການກະທຳຂອງທ່ານ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງຢູ່ພາຍໃນການກະທຳ (<abbrev>ກໍຄື</"
"abbrev> ບໍ່ແມ່ນຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງສອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂອງການກະທຳໜຶ່ງ)."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:38
msgid "The new menu is inserted at the correct place, regarding the default « <literal>New Caja menu</literal> » label."
msgstr ""
"ເມນູໃໝ່ຈະຖືກແຊກລົງໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໂດຍມີປ້າຍຊື່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄື « <literal>ເມນູ Caja ໃໝ່</literal> "
"»."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:51
msgid "As an action, too, a menu requires a label, and may have an icon and a tooltip. Also, you may define some conditions in order your menu be candidate to be displayed in <productname>Caja</productname> context menu. If the defined conditions are not met at runtime, then your whole menu, including its submenus, its actions and so on, will not be displayed."
msgstr ""
"ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບການກະທຳ, ເມນູກໍຕ້ອງການປ້າຍຊື່, ແລະ ອາດມີໄອຄອນ ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳເຄື່ອງມື. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ທ່ານ"
"ຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດບາງເງື່ອນໄຂເພື່ອໃຫ້ເມນູຂອງທ່ານມີສິດຖືກສະແດງໃນເມນູຄລິກຂວາຂອງ <productname>"
"Caja</productname>. ຖ້າເງື່ອນໄຂທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ບໍ່ສອດຄ່ອງໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກ, ເມນູທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມທັງເ"
"ມນູຍ່ອຍ, ການກະທຳ ແລະ ສ່ວນອື່ນໆ, ກໍຈະບໍ່ຖືກສະແດງ."

#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:3
msgid "Your actions and menus will be displayed in file manager context menus in the same order that they are listed in the <guilabel>Items list</guilabel>, on the left pane of the main <application>Caja-Actions Configuration Tool</application> window."
msgstr ""
"ການກະທຳ ແລະ ເມນູຂອງທ່ານຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນເມນູຄລິກຂວາຂອງຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ຕາມລຳດັບດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກລ"
"ະບຸໄວ້ໃນ <guilabel>ລາຍການລາຍການ</guilabel>, ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຫຼັກຂອງ "
"<application>ເຄື່ອງມືຕັ້ງຄ່າ Caja-Actions</application>."

