msgid "Miscellaneous informations"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເບັດເຕັດອື່ນໆ"

#. (itstool) path: sect1/para
#: C/index.docbook:1
msgid "The new action is also displayed in red color in the items list. Red color is used as an indicator that the item is invalid, that is that the item cannot be candidate to be displayed in a <productname>Caja</productname> context menu because some of its informations are missing or erroneous. Here, and though this newly inserted action has some suitable defaults, it lacks a command to be executed to be considered valid by <application>Caja-Actions Configuration Tool</application>"
msgstr ""
"ການກະທຳໃໝ່ຍັງຖືກສະແດງເປັນສີແດງໃນລາຍການລາຍການ. ສີແດງຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ວ່າລາຍການນັ້ນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ນັ້ນ"
"ຄືລາຍການນັ້ນບໍ່ມີສິດຖືກສະແດງໃນເມນູຄລິກຂວາຂອງ <productname>Caja</productname> ເພາະຂໍ້ມູນບາງ"
"ສ່ວນຂາດຫາຍໄປ ຫຼື ຜິດພາດ. ໃນທີ່ນີ້, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການກະທຳທີ່ແຊກໃໝ່ນີ້ຈະມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ເໝາະສົມບາງຢ່າງ, ແຕ່ມັ"
"ນຍັງຂາດຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ <application>ເຄື່ອງມືຕັ້ງຄ່າ Caja-Actions</application> ຖື"
"ວ່າມັນຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. (itstool) path: sect1/title
#: C/index.docbook:181
msgid "Known Bugs and Limitations"
