#. (itstool) path: sect2/para
#: C/index.docbook:7
msgid "If you find some new bug in <productname>Caja-Actions</productname>, you are welcome to open it by pointing your favorite browser to <ulink url=\"https://github.com/NiceandGently/caja-actions/issues\" type=\"http\">Bugzilla web site</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃໝ່ໃນ <productname>Caja-Actions</productname>, ທ່ານສາມາດແຈ້ງມັນໄດ້ໂດຍ"
"ການໄປທີ່ <ulink url=\"https://github.com/NiceandGently/caja-actions/issues\" "
"type=\"http\">ເວັບໄຊ Bugzilla</ulink>."

#. (itstool) path: formalpara/para
#: C/index.docbook:18
msgid "As of version 3.0, execution mode may be configured in <application>Caja-Actions Configuration Tool</application> but is not yet honored by <productname>Caja</productname> plugin."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເວີຊັນ 3.0 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ໂໝດການປະຕິບັດງານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໃນ <application>ເຄື່ອງມືຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"Caja-Actions</application> ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍປລັກອິນ <productname>Caja</"
"productname>."

#. (itstool) path: formalpara/para
#: C/index.docbook:30
msgid "As of version 3.0, suggested shortcut, as described in DES-EMA specification, cannot be configured in <application>Caja-Actions Configuration Tool</application>, and is not honored by <productname>Caja</productname> plugin."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເວີຊັນ 3.0 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ທາງລັດທີ່ແນະນຳ ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໃນຂໍ້ກຳນົດ DES-EMA, ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໃນ "
"<application>ເຄື່ອງມືຕັ້ງຄ່າ Caja-Actions</application>, ແລະ ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໂດຍປລັ"
"ກອິນ <productname>Caja</productname>."

#. (itstool) path: formalpara/para
#: C/index.docbook:38
msgid "As of version 3.0, menu separators cannot be configured in <application>Caja-Actions Configuration Tool</application>, and are not honored by <productname>Caja</productname> plugin."
